    {"type":"text","id":"briefer_block_text","x":1380,"y":400,"width":240,"height":260,"text":"☀ MORNING BRIEFER\nwakes up\n\nReads every anchor,\nentity, reminder.\n\nSees: Mary asked\ntwice + Wed deadline\n+ reschedule request.\n\nDecides: this is the\nONE THING for today.\n\nDrafts a 4-line reply:\nmetrics by tonight,\naccepts Friday.","originalText":"☀ MORNING BRIEFER\nwakes up\n\nReads every anchor,\nentity, reminder.\n\nSees: Mary asked\ntwice + Wed deadline\n+ reschedule request.\n\nDecides: this is the\nONE THING for today.\n\nDrafts a 4-line reply:\nmetrics by tonight,\naccepts Friday.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#4c1d95","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":430111,"version":1,"versionNonce":430111,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"briefer_block","lineHeight":1.3},

